  ('52076be4-1130-5d88-968c-5f39083c4ea0', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g9-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$How does the detail that Tomas never wrote anything down during his eleven wins help develop the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It explains why he was unable to remember the moves of the game he lost to Lin.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"It suggests his wins taught him little, because he never stopped to examine how he played.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that Mrs. Adeyemi had never asked any club member to keep a record before.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It proves that his eleven wins were the result of luck rather than any real skill.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-claim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It suggests his wins taught him little, because he never stopped to examine how he played.$q$, $q$The text says he wrote nothing "because there had seemed to be nothing to learn," which contrasts with the six pages he fills after losing. Nothing in the story says his wins were luck, so that choice overstates the detail.$q$, 'draft', 'c542e562-63e4-56f5-9fec-55eb5210faad')
