   $q$How does the line "each one a runner with no finish line" help develop the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It compares each generation to a relay runner who passes the journey on rather than completing it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that the butterflies become lost because they have no clear destination.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It suggests that the butterflies are racing one another to reach the lakes first.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"It hints that the speaker thinks the migration is pointless and should end.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It compares each generation to a relay runner who passes the journey on rather than completing it.$q$, $q$The next line, "handing the north to someone new," shows each generation passing the journey on like a relay. The butterflies are not competing, so reading the line as a race takes it too literally.$q$, 'draft', 'cb146cb0-3216-53e1-887d-2b0f5e020adb')
