  ('bc041296-4ce1-50fc-a643-a39264054d11', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-authors-purpose'), null, 'easy',
   $q$What is the author's main purpose in this column?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To persuade residents to support shielded streetlights so the night sky becomes visible again","is_correct":true},{"text":"To describe how Pine Hollow has changed in the forty years since the author arrived there","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"To argue that the town should turn off all of its outdoor lights after dark each night","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"To explain how amateur astronomers use telescopes to find the Milky Way on clear nights","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To persuade residents to support shielded streetlights so the night sky becomes visible again$q$, $q$The column builds toward a request that readers speak in favor of shielded streetlights on Main Street so the stars can be seen again. The author directly says "I am not asking anyone to turn off a single light," so the choice about turning off all lights contradicts her.$q$, 'draft', 'ebc360fc-3e45-5a02-8f90-48b2cd3cddcd')
