   $q$What is the purpose of the question "Why should we remember them now"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It anticipates a reader's doubt and introduces the author's reason that the records are still used.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows the author cannot think of a good reason to remember the volunteers.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"It asks readers to send in their own memories of weather from the 1800s.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"It signals that the article is about to change to an unrelated topic.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It anticipates a reader's doubt and introduces the author's reason that the records are still used.$q$, $q$The author answers his own question immediately: "Because their notebooks are still in use." The question voices what a skeptical reader might ask so he can respond to it.$q$, 'draft', '3afc60df-1469-543f-8804-643b3b3788c0')
