   $q$Which two motivations conflict inside Priya?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Her wish to please Mr. Castellanos and her wish to quit the showcase.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Her wish to visit Teo on Sundays and her wish to keep the project secret.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Her wish to win the internship and her sense that Teo deserves credit.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Her wish to fix the sensor herself and her wish to buy a new one instead.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Her wish to win the internship and her sense that Teo deserves credit.$q$, $q$"Priya wanted to win," yet she keeps filling in and deleting the contributor line because Teo wrote the fix. She never considers quitting the showcase.$q$, 'draft', '94d714ad-1d2b-5673-adb0-305456ae689a')
