  ('ce53907b-9507-56d9-8895-4c6abc477162', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-character-setting-plot'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which detail best shows Priya's inner conflict before she talks to Teo?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She spent a week rewiring the sensor and got nowhere with the readings.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-evidence"},{"text":"The numbers settled down like a dog that had finally been told to sit.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-evidence"},{"text":"She left the second line blank, then filled it in, then deleted it again.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The station now had a website, a live graph, and a spot in the showcase.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-evidence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She left the second line blank, then filled it in, then deleted it again.$q$, $q$Filling in and deleting the line shows her going back and forth between credit and winning. The rewiring detail shows frustration with the sensor, not a conflict about credit.$q$, 'draft', '94d714ad-1d2b-5673-adb0-305456ae689a')
