   $q$How does Text 2 transform the fable's string?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It keeps the string exactly as it is, since the balloon stays tied to Yusra's hand the whole time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It turns the string into a symbol of danger that the club must cut away as quickly as possible.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"It removes any idea of connection, since the balloon is lost once it disappears from view.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It replaces the physical string with a radio signal and careful planning that keep a connection after release.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It replaces the physical string with a radio signal and careful planning that keep a connection after release.$q$, $q$Yusra realizes the real connection "was the signal, and the months of planning," and the beacon leads them to the payload. The balloon is not lost, so the choice saying connection disappears contradicts the ending.$q$, 'draft', '59b3cd2c-92ca-524f-9823-2f13b7c6d076')
