   $q$What was the main difference between the two roads in the study?$q$, $q$[{"text":"One road had moth traps and the other had no traps at all.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"One road received white LED lamps and the other received amber LED lamps.","is_correct":true},{"text":"One road was in town and the other was in the countryside.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"One road kept the old orange lamps and the other received new LEDs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$One road received white LED lamps and the other received amber LED lamps.$q$, $q$The second paragraph says crews installed "standard white lamps" on the first road and "amber LEDs" on the second. Both were "similar country roads," and both had traps.$q$, 'draft', 'be6f3449-9508-5af4-ba78-21ded9c58cc3')
