   $q$Which statement best summarizes what Rahimi's findings suggest about the system's costs?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The system caused serious delays for drivers and hurt nearby businesses.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The system added small delays on side streets without a clear harm to local shops.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The system had no effect at all on cars waiting on the side streets.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstatement"},{"text":"The system helped side-street drivers by making all lights change faster.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The system added small delays on side streets without a clear harm to local shops.$q$, $q$Rahimi found a delay of "four seconds per light" and sales records that "showed no clear drop." The delay was small but real, so saying the system had no effect at all overstates the finding.$q$, 'draft', '2a608e7a-88c7-5ab8-b406-52d9b9a1ba2e')
